    "name": "Uncrashed : FPV Drone Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 1682970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From pilots with no real-life experience to experienced pilots who want to improve their skills, <strong><i>Uncrashed</i></strong> will provide you the opportunity to fly FPV drones in a beautiful, realistic simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the race to the next level without risking breaking your drone or your bank account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/58b070ae5e1a9c96dc985a12322a07fc.poster.avif?t=1744907113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/58b070ae5e1a9c96dc985a12322a07fc.webm?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/58b070ae5e1a9c96dc985a12322a07fc.mp4?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the skies alongside fellow players, dive into competitive races with friends, or strive for dominance on the leaderboards. Multiplayer transforms training into a captivating and thrilling adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MANY BIG MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it's for freestyle or race training, the many large and diverse maps have been designed by a team with extensive FPV knowledge to give you a better flying experience. From parks to the best abandoned places, you have never seen such beautiful spots for FPV drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENVIRONMENT &amp; TRACK EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own environment, your own races or take advantage of the thousands of community creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EASY TO USE SETTINGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple settings, based on real values will allow you to easily reproduce your own drone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/30b23b8c8df87482d2e577deda811b9a.poster.avif?t=1744907113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/30b23b8c8df87482d2e577deda811b9a.webm?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/30b23b8c8df87482d2e577deda811b9a.mp4?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FOR MORE ADVANCED USER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can even fine-tune physics settings like gravity, air friction or even propeller efficiency depending on the throttle level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/383c8df7f5e374503588f6a278d281cf.poster.avif?t=1744907113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/383c8df7f5e374503588f6a278d281cf.webm?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/383c8df7f5e374503588f6a278d281cf.mp4?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any Joystick/gamepad recognized by Windows will work, but a radio-controller is highly recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support for PC-compatible radio-controller.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From pilots with no real-life experience to experienced pilots who want to improve their skills, <strong><i>Uncrashed</i></strong> will provide you the opportunity to fly FPV drones in a beautiful, realistic simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the race to the next level without risking breaking your drone or your bank account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/58b070ae5e1a9c96dc985a12322a07fc.poster.avif?t=1744907113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/58b070ae5e1a9c96dc985a12322a07fc.webm?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/58b070ae5e1a9c96dc985a12322a07fc.mp4?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the skies alongside fellow players, dive into competitive races with friends, or strive for dominance on the leaderboards. Multiplayer transforms training into a captivating and thrilling adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MANY BIG MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it's for freestyle or race training, the many large and diverse maps have been designed by a team with extensive FPV knowledge to give you a better flying experience. From parks to the best abandoned places, you have never seen such beautiful spots for FPV drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENVIRONMENT &amp; TRACK EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own environment, your own races or take advantage of the thousands of community creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EASY TO USE SETTINGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple settings, based on real values will allow you to easily reproduce your own drone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/30b23b8c8df87482d2e577deda811b9a.poster.avif?t=1744907113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/30b23b8c8df87482d2e577deda811b9a.webm?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/30b23b8c8df87482d2e577deda811b9a.mp4?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FOR MORE ADVANCED USER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can even fine-tune physics settings like gravity, air friction or even propeller efficiency depending on the throttle level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/383c8df7f5e374503588f6a278d281cf.poster.avif?t=1744907113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/383c8df7f5e374503588f6a278d281cf.webm?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682970/extras/383c8df7f5e374503588f6a278d281cf.mp4?t=1744907113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any Joystick/gamepad recognized by Windows will work, but a radio-controller is highly recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support for PC-compatible radio-controller.</p>",
    "short_description": "Amateur or experienced FPV pilot, learn or improve your skills on Uncrashed,the new ultra realistic FPV simulator. Simulate your own FPV drone with settings based on real values and you will have the same feeling as a real flight without the risk of breaking your drone !",
